  <item>
    <title>EP9｜青年艺术家，到底在想啥</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6240ff0ed1a368a95a76904b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6240ff0ed1a368a95a76904b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Mar 2022 00:12:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，主播将会和两位毕业于芝加哥艺术学院的青年艺术家聊聊当代艺术的创作和消费。</span></p><br><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><br><p><span>艺术家都有什么“出路”</span></p><p><span>芝加哥艺术学院的学生在干什么</span></p><p><span>当代艺术重要的是概念，不是媒介</span></p><p><span>如何提升艺术语言</span></p><p><span>怎样理解“讨好观众”</span></p><p><span>艺术界的话语权：创作者、学术圈、金融界、收藏家</span></p><p><span>拍摄关于芝加哥华人外卖员的纪录片</span></p><p><span>驻地艺术家项目与房地产</span></p><p><span>中美的艺术消费和艺术教育</span></p><p><span>徐冰、奥基弗、达米安赫斯特、Thomas Thwaites</span></p><br><br><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><br><p><span>陈俪莎，青年艺术家，毕业于芝加哥艺术学院。关键词：影像，行为艺术，社会系统</span></p><p><span>个人网站：</span><span><span><a data-url="https://www.lishaaa.net/" href="https://www.lishaaa.net/">www.lishaaa.net</a></span></span><span>，</span></p><p><span>相关采访：</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="http://wap.art.ifeng.com/?app=system&amp;controller=artmobile&amp;action=content&amp;contentid=3521488" href="http://wap.art.ifeng.com/?app=system&amp;controller=artmobile&amp;action=content&amp;contentid=3521488">wap.art.ifeng.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>崔德成，青年艺术家，毕业于芝加哥艺术学院。关键词：绘画，观念，数字艺术，感性与理性</span></p><p><span>个人网站：</span><span><span><a data-url="https://zh.cuidecheng.com/" href="https://zh.cuidecheng.com/">zh.cuidecheng.com</a></span></span><span>，</span></p><p><span>相关采访：</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://www.sohu.com/a/517272476_120091044" href="https://www.sohu.com/a/517272476_120091044">www.sohu.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>拓展阅读/观看:</span></p><br><p><span>徐冰&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="http://www.xubing.com/cn/exhibition/details/468?year=2017" href="http://www.xubing.com/cn/exhibition/details/468?year=2017">www.xubing.com</a></span></span></p><p><span>乔治亚·奥基弗</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/" href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/">baike.baidu.com</a>乔治亚·奥基弗/190221</span></span></p><p><span>山羊人，Thomas Thwaites</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://www.thomasthwaites.com" href="https://www.thomasthwaites.com">www.thomasthwaites.com</a></span></span></p><p><span>生者对死者的无动于衷，达米安赫斯特，1991</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/s/video/BV1AA411J7Qy" href="https://www.bilibili.com/s/video/BV1AA411J7Qy">www.bilibili.com</a></span></span></p><br><br><p><span>BGM:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Philip Glass - String&nbsp;Quartet&nbsp;No.&nbsp;5&nbsp;(1991)&nbsp;-&nbsp;III</span></p><br><br><p><span>配图:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Georgia O’Keeffe, 1937, Red Hills with Flowers</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
