  <item>
    <title>EP7｜关于芝加哥枪击：记录与纪念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61916b1aceafa8518f8995c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61916b1aceafa8518f8995c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Nov 2021 19:52:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于芝加哥枪击：记录与纪念</span></p><br><p><span>大家好，我是李借之。11月9日，一名来自中国的芝加哥大学毕业生在离本期录制地点，我朋友的公寓100米左右的地方不幸因罹难。同样身为芝大学生，我们深感悲痛和惋惜。今天是周末，我和几个同学相聚，浅聊我们身边发生的这件事情，最近的学习生活经历，以及所观察到的问题。希望逝者安息，事件能被相对妥善的处理，情况能有所改变。</span></p><br><p><span>本期声音来源是五名身处芝加哥大学的中国留学生：李借之、西西、Jaden、Leo，和佩琦。</span></p><br><p><span>结尾音乐：Luke Howard, passion/sleep</span></p><br><br><p><span>帮助/行动途径：</span></p><br><p><span>1、募捐：In memory of Dennis, organized by Zewei Chu and Yue Zou</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://www.gofundme.com/f/qt9dyu-in-memory-of-dennis?member=15181637&amp;sharetype=teams&amp;utm_campaign=p_na+share-sheet&amp;utm_medium=copy_link&amp;utm_source=customer" href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/qt9dyu-in-memory-of-dennis?member=15181637&amp;sharetype=teams&amp;utm_campaign=p_na+share-sheet&amp;utm_medium=copy_link&amp;utm_source=customer">www.gofundme.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>2、[纪念郑同学] 港大校友会募捐进展</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ECwkMxB8P8_ezJwb3drvCA" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ECwkMxB8P8_ezJwb3drvCA">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>3、校园集会：</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfP3W6kbe4TDZTJAFRz3SsScomgzAvV3RMUgkX_xM-XT0J5Dg/viewform" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfP3W6kbe4TDZTJAFRz3SsScomgzAvV3RMUgkX_xM-XT0J5Dg/viewform">docs.google.com</a></span></span></p><br><br><p><span>相关阅读：</span></p><br><p><span>1、在人间｜ 芝加哥枪声之后，妈妈决定冒着疫情风险去美国接他回家</span></p><p><span>文｜在人间</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QZ4AxGHO5b3GY7doobVpUw" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QZ4AxGHO5b3GY7doobVpUw">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>2、风向｜又一中国留学生命丧枪击案，百年原罪撕裂芝加哥</span></p><p><span>文｜成律</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://ishare.ifeng.com/c/s/v004i9E1Xse8onfdQdbxpnftD4A7vyYXgBnREHvcEzJUvtA__?spss=np&amp;channelId=&amp;aman=eehd837d2640086dc2icbfh1f4KcefV12aZ637Za43&amp;gud=3B2600529G476O500E000u004" href="https://ishare.ifeng.com/c/s/v004i9E1Xse8onfdQdbxpnftD4A7vyYXgBnREHvcEzJUvtA__?spss=np&amp;channelId=&amp;aman=eehd837d2640086dc2icbfh1f4KcefV12aZ637Za43&amp;gud=3B2600529G476O500E000u004">ishare.ifeng.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>3、【学联通告】《芝加哥大学校园及周边社区安全改善提案》草案公布</span></p><p><span>文｜芝大中国学联</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DShCT-xN0OjJBQ943igIaA" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DShCT-xN0OjJBQ943igIaA">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>4、The Chicago Maroon 对事件的报道：18-Year-Old Charged with Murder of Shaoxiong Zheng; Community Responds to Recent Violence</span></p><p><span>文｜Yiwen Lu</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://chicagomaroon.com/article/2021/11/12/18-year-old-charged-murder-shaoxiong-zheng-community/" href="https://chicagomaroon.com/article/2021/11/12/18-year-old-charged-murder-shaoxiong-zheng-community/">chicagomaroon.com</a></span></span></p><br><p><span>5、Chicago Tribune 的相关报道：‘I arrived a few minutes too late,’ says doctor who tried to save international student killed in Hyde Park</span></p><p><span>文｜ </span><span><span>SYLVIA GOODMAN</span></span><span>， KATHERINE ROSENBERG-DOUGLAS</span></p><p><span><span><a data-url="https://www.chicagotribune.com/news/breaking/ct-university-chicago-graduate-killed-hyde-park-20211110-jcqptf2mpjhszjjlblzygsocdq-story.html" href="https://www.chicagotribune.com/news/breaking/ct-university-chicago-graduate-killed-hyde-park-20211110-jcqptf2mpjhszjjlblzygsocdq-story.html">www.chicagotribune.com</a></span></span></p><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>]]></description>
